---
import DemoLayout from '@/layouts/DemoLayout.astro';
import { Wrapper, Stack, Frame, Media, Box, Flow, Layer, Center, Inline, Heading } from 'lism-css/astro';
---

<DemoLayout title="General09">
  <Wrapper isContainer py="50">
    <Frame ar={['4/3', '16/9', '21/9']} pos="relative" max-sz="full">
      <Media src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584412182057-c4c8a22ff533?auto=format&fit=max&w=1920&q=80" alt="" width="960" height="640" />
      <Layer bgc="rgb(0 0 0 / 20%)" style={{ backdropFilter: 'blur(8px)' }}>
        <Center h="100%" c="white">
          <Inline fz={['3xl', '4xl']} fw="normal" ff="accent" fs="italic" lts="l" px="20" py="10" mbs={['-20', '-30']}>Story</Inline>
        </Center>
      </Layer>
    </Frame>
    <Box hasGutter mbs={['-45', '-50', '-60']} pos="relative">
      <Stack bgc="base" p={['35', '40', '45']} g="40">
        <Heading level="2" class="u--trim" aslf="center" fz={['xl', '2xl']}>A Town Where People and Nature Grow Together</Heading>
        <Flow>
          <p>
            While passing on our rich natural environment to the next generation, we are promoting the creation of spaces where urban life and nature
            coexist in harmony. We aim to contribute to the realization of a sustainable society. Together, we are building a sustainable future.
          </p>
          <p>
            We are creating green paths throughout the town that are a joy to walk. By linking parks and plazas with trees, we have made it possible
            to feel the changing seasons on a stroll or the daily commute.
          </p>
          <p>
            Local residents also take part in caring for the plantings. Planting seedlings and tending flower beds with children has become a valuable
            chance for people of every generation to meet.
          </p>
          <p>
            Greenery is not finished on the day it is planted. Just as trees grow over many years, a town grows little by little together with the
            people who live there. We will keep building a town where people and nature grow together.
          </p>
        </Flow>
      </Stack>
    </Box>
  </Wrapper>
</DemoLayout>
